 m (13 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;4 m (13 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Gale exudes Necrotic energy. Creature takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1~4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage every turn.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Necrotic_Aura\">Sources of Necrotic Aura</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a> has this condition when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\">Dead</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>If Gale is revived from a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Downed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Downed</a> state (not Dead) by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Revivify\" title=\"Revivify\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/20px-Revivify_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/30px-Revivify_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/40px-Revivify_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Revivify\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/20px-Revivify_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Revivify\" title=\"Revivify\">Revivify</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Revivify\" title=\"Scroll of Revivify\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Revivify\" title=\"Scroll of Revivify\">Scroll of Revivify</a>, or <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_True_Resurrection\" title=\"Scroll of True Resurrection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_True_Resurrection\" title=\"Scroll of True Resurrection\">Scroll of True Resurrection</a> he receives Necrotic Aura at the start of his next turn in combat (or after 6 seconds when out of combat) despite being alive due to a possibly miscoded script. See <code>GLO_Origin_Gale_Death</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GLO_Origin_Gale_Death+type:script\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GLO_Origin_Gale_Death+type:script\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200531\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.095 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3848/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40469/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13128/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansio